===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[nature]], [[environment]] {{gloss|the natural world}}
#: {{syn|fi|ympäristö}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Luontoa''' on suojeltava.|'''Nature''' must be protected.}}
# [[nature]] {{gloss|the order of the natural world; the physical world in contrast to manmade or spiritual things or concepts}}
# [[character]], [[nature]], [[characteristic]]s {{gloss|of a thing}}
# [[character]], [[nature]], [[characteristic]]s {{gloss|of a person}}
#: {{syn|fi|luonne}}
#: {{coi|fi|[[käydä]] {{fi-vp-joku|possessive}} '''luonnolle'''|q=+ first infinitive|to be (very) hard for someone (to do something); to pain someone greatly (to do something)}}
#: {{ux|fi|Hän on hyvä'''luontoinen'''. / Hänellä on hyvä '''luonto'''.|She is good-'''natured'''. / She has a good '''nature'''.}}

====Usage notes====
* {{sense|character, nature of a person}} Now quite uncommon in this sense outside of set phrases; the noun {{m|fi|luonne}} or a compound adjective with {{m|fi|-luontoinen}} tends to be used more.

